          "unit_sha256": "12a0139dfda6e11c3a0f54c3d1e9165bf1c62ae04c2c31551ce0e9ebe3563fd2",
          "fragment_sha256": "27d1cb6582de36744345b13fef552b2b9e5a36d5bb844e6dcc9d1b13b294dcf0",
          "start_line": 1,
          "end_line": 1,
          "start_offset": 0,
          "end_offset": 40,
          "physical_page": null,
          "origin_kind": "original",
          "supplement_id": null,
          "text": "这是TASK106-C01明确合成的余额算法资料，不是现实数据库隔离级别背书。\n"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "1c5f548d-f306-4376-a717-245144d80218",
          "version_id": "1880b1e1-808f-4d48-9813-e98c9fec1419",
          "source_revision": 1,
          "citation_id": "ic_114e3de83a46ab31b67e00e5",
          "evidence_id": "ev_301f427e55ab77a3e84f9737bc5cd2938d710f8b78b4d612925149334ee1ab22",
          "title": "TASK106-C01-虚构余额算法.md",
          "format": "md",
          "original_sha256": "12a0139dfda6e11c3a0f54c3d1e9165bf1c62ae04c2c31551ce0e9ebe3563fd2",
          "unit_sha256": "12a0139dfda6e11c3a0f54c3d1e9165bf1c62ae04c2c31551ce0e9ebe3563fd2",
          "fragment_sha256": "c23438afe9476ba655ee2aea409ecd67efd55642f0860944797eab4f37fc45b6",
          "start_line": 2,
          "end_line": 2,
          "start_offset": 40,
          "end_offset": 78,
          "physical_page": null,
          "origin_kind": "original",
          "supplement_id": null,
          "text": "算法：先单独读取余额，计算后写回；给定初值100，一次加20、一次减10。\n"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "1c5f548d-f306-4376-a717-245144d80218",
          "version_id": "1880b1e1-808f-4d48-9813-e98c9fec1419",
          "source_revision": 1,
          "citation_id": "ic_76a2b168a515f74d0d5d1674",
          "evidence_id": "ev_46850aaa4122945f859fde422e60400ced7fbc6be60667a33a5271f9d050a101",
          "title": "TASK106-C01-虚构余额算法.md",
          "format": "md",
          "original_sha256": "12a0139dfda6e11c3a0f54c3d1e9165bf1c62ae04c2c31551ce0e9ebe3563fd2",
          "unit_sha256": "12a0139dfda6e11c3a0f54c3d1e9165bf1c62ae04c2c31551ce0e9ebe3563fd2",
          "fragment_sha256": "025f57e1df889ed033828802d41f06550b57355d9857202f96c089289378f6da",
          "start_line": 5,
          "end_line": 5,
          "start_offset": 141,
          "end_offset": 186,
          "physical_page": null,
          "origin_kind": "original",
          "supplement_id": null,
          "text": "这些判断只针对上述明确算法与小事务轨迹，不推断任何PostgreSQL隔离级别实际表现。\n"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "1c5f548d-f306-4376-a717-245144d80218",
          "version_id": "1880b1e1-808f-4d48-9813-e98c9fec1419",
          "source_revision": 1,
          "citation_id": "ic_df3efaddd98fe647eafc7d1f",
          "evidence_id": "ev_797c39a69e08de9853bba2c28a1b73c05ef594f8bcbcd8e7151ee90271c3de73",
          "title": "TASK106-C01-虚构余额算法.md",
          "format": "md",
          "original_sha256": "12a0139dfda6e11c3a0f54c3d1e9165bf1c62ae04c2c31551ce0e9ebe3563fd2",
          "unit_sha256": "12a0139dfda6e11c3a0f54c3d1e9165bf1c62ae04c2c31551ce0e9ebe3563fd2",
          "fragment_sha256": "5fb0440f6dc96a5e15f7bd57e8b5dca667856c350ef45e8058ff0d78a8a9c5c8",
          "start_line": 4,
          "end_line": 4,
          "start_offset": 93,
          "end_offset": 141,
          "physical_page": null,
          "origin_kind": "original",
          "supplement_id": null,
          "text": "两个操作均先读取100，再分别写120和90，可覆盖一次写回；按给定顺序最后写90就留下90。\n"
        },
        {
          "source_id": "1c5f548d-f306-4376-a717-245144d80218",
          "version_id": "1880b1e1-808f-4d48-9813-e98c9fec1419",
          "source_revision": 1,
          "citation_id": "ic_35089eca544afdebc0ca9234",
          "evidence_id": "ev_7bde6ab07d6af8cafe736a7c63f8f32a13033495011f4499a365c6f26d1a4297",
          "title": "TASK106-C01-虚构余额算法.md",
          "format": "md",
          "original_sha256": "12a0139dfda6e11c3a0f54c3d1e9165bf1c62ae04c2c31551ce0e9ebe3563fd2",
          "unit_sha256": "12a0139dfda6e11c3a0f54c3d1e9165bf1c62ae04c2c31551ce0e9ebe3563fd2",
          "fragment_sha256": "387c24389111ed59e3f21e119ecdd6714f8eb26998afcb1b1257cf972fa407e0",
          "start_line": 3,
          "end_line": 3,
          "start_offset": 78,
          "end_offset": 93,
          "physical_page": null,
          "origin_kind": "original",
          "supplement_id": null,
          "text": "串行执行的最终数值为110。\n"
        }
      ],
